lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhang Wei is the performance champion of the department, but he encounters some challenges in his recent project, which causes his performance to be not good. Li Yun is the department manager, he always supports Zhang Wei, hoping to fight for the best evaluation for him in the year-end review. Chen Tao is Zhang Wei's colleague, he also hopes to get promoted in the year-end review. This afternoon, Li Yun quickly browses Zhang Wei's review form in the office. When Zhang Wei passes by Li Yun's office, Li Yun looks up at him and nods to him. Zhang Wei gives a slight smile to Li Yun and continues to walk past. Chen Tao sees all this in the tea room not far away.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Li Yun nod to Zhang Wei?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Li Yun is greeting Zhang Wei.\nB. Li Yun nods to Zhang Wei unintentionally.\nC. Li Yun just sees Zhang Wei's review form and thinks his performance is good.\nD. Li Yun wants to tell Zhang Wei that he gets a high evaluation.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004069975375218939,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58bcb9aa9dc5a833d5618","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794477003093,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:50:03","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"3ad96d86024140f2b7353ce59cbb5f35"}